  "description": "A web-based simulation environment designed to model and visualize emergent synchronization patterns in firefly populations using phase-coupled oscillator logic. The project leverages the Next.js App Router and TypeScript to implement agent-based dynamics where decentralized entities reach spontaneous order through local interactions. It provides a performant frontend scaffold for exploring biological entrainment and non-linear systems theory.",
